# src/apps/daemon/internal/analysis/immunization

## Purpose
Autonomous Self-Immunization Engine: detects real-time DPI middlebox interference (RST injection, SNI reset, handshake dropout), dynamically tests evasion recipes, and maintains an in-memory and persistent Immune Memory of evasion antibodies.

## Contents
- `types.go`: Core data models: `InterferenceType`, `EvasionAntibody`, `PacketTimingProfile`.
- `detector.go`: Non-invasive passive detector diagnosing middlebox interference from connection failures and timing anomalies.
- `synthesizer.go`: Active ladder synthesizer testing evasion variations (SNI split, TCP desync offsets, decoy packet flags) to discover winning antibodies.
- `store.go`: Thread-safe Immune Memory cache providing exact and wildcard domain matching, efficacy scoring, and JSON export/import.

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Imported by daemon runtime and routing layers to automatically immunize outbound connections against hostile firewalls without manual user intervention.
- Belongs to Dependency Band 6 (Analysis); imports Band 3 (`protocols/tlsfragment`) and Band 1 (`foundation/`).
